  "summary": "EFF reports on two state-level executive actions curbing ALPRs: Texas Governor Abbott's August 28 order banning state agencies from spending public funds on Flock cameras, and Florida DOT's August 31 memo (announced by Governor DeSantis) ordering removal of all ALPRs from state highway rights-of-way within 30 days and revoking existing permits. EFF frames these as part of growing bipartisan pushback and urges California to follow suit.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "On August 28, Texas Governor Greg Abbott banned state agencies from spending public funds on Flock cameras.",
      "paragraph_idx": 6
    },
    {
      "quote": "the Florida Department of Transportation (FDOT) issued a memo, announced by Governor Ron DeSantis, ordering the removal of all ALPRs from the right-of-way on state highways within 30 days.",
      "paragraph_idx": 7
    },
    {
      "quote": "during the last 30 days, an average of three localities per day has halted contracts with Flock.",
      "paragraph_idx": 10
    }
  ],
